data: {"type":"agent_chunk","agent":"critic","content":"- **Single-source claims:** The Cas9 targeting claim and the broad-application claim each rest on one citation, with no corroboration.\n- **Pathway conflation:** Insertion is attributed to non-homologous end joining, which is error-prone. Precise insertion usually requires homology-directed repair, so this needs correction.\n- **Missing safety angle:** The review never mentions off-target cutting or ethical limits, which are central to any claim about medical or agricultural use."}

